# Milestone: v0.11.4-cat-f
# Covers: an uncaught VM-internal lookup failure prints a !!! diagnostic
#         carrying the instance message (D-F2 backward-compat), not bare nil.
# Re-foundation: a missing slot raises LookupError, not TypeError -- see the
# note in objects/lookup.chk.
1.noSuchSlotXYZ;
[00000000] !!! LookupError: slot access: slot 'noSuchSlotXYZ' not found
